      "description": "Original1970 effective-stress constant-nu incremental3D closure; project endpoint-principal average, max-D history and declared10psf numerical failure modulus. Exact-tie lazy spectral expressions select scalar cluster-average branch rows, not a unique classical or proven whole-residual Clarke tangent. No numerical qualification, scientific approval, calibration or finite-rotation claim.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "url": "https://doi.org/10.1061/JSFEAQ.0001458",
          "locator": "Original1970 pp1631\u20131648 Eqs3\u201315, constant nu1642, average stress1642/1646\u201347, max-D memory1645; complete retained source receipts under ingestion/duncan-chang-1970/v2/v4",
